Package: presencemux-ffs-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: FunctionFS of PresenceMux with USB Video Class descriptors
 The usb_f_fs module of the Raspberry Pi kernel 6.18.50+rpt-rpi-2712, with
 one patch: FunctionFS accepts the class-specific descriptors of the video
 class. The cam worker of PresenceMux then implements the USB camera
 function in userspace, with a bulk endpoint.
 .
 DKMS builds the module only for that kernel. On another kernel, the stock
 module loads and rejects the camera descriptors.
